<div class="product__reassurance" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <modal-opener data-modal="#ReassuranceShipping-{{ block.id }}"><button type="button" class="product__reassurance-link" data-pdp-reassurance="shipping">Free U.S. shipping</button></modal-opener>
  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Ships in 1–2 business days</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <modal-opener data-modal="#ReassuranceGuarantee-{{ block.id }}"><button type="button" class="product__reassurance-link" data-pdp-reassurance="guarantee">60-day promise</button></modal-opener>
</div>
<modal-dialog id="ReassuranceShipping-{{ block.id }}" class="product-popup-modal product-guarantee-modal"><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ReassuranceShippingHeading-{{ block.id }}" class="product-popup-modal__content product-guarantee-modal__content" tabindex="-1"><header class="product-guarantee-modal__header"><h2 id="ReassuranceShippingHeading-{{ block.id }}">Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2><button id="ModalClose-ReassuranceShipping-{{ block.id }}" type="button" class="product-guarantee-modal__close" aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">{{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</button></header><div class="product-guarantee-modal__body rte"><p>Most orders leave Roman Skin within 1–2 business days. Free standard shipping is available on U.S. orders over $99, before taxes and after discounts.</p><p>Tracking is emailed after shipment. Carrier delivery times are estimates.</p><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url | default: '/policies/shipping-policy' }}" class="button button--primary">Read Full Shipping Policy</a></div></div></modal-dialog>
<modal-dialog id="ReassuranceGuarantee-{{ block.id }}" class="product-popup-modal product-guarantee-modal"><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ReassuranceGuaranteeHeading-{{ block.id }}" class="product-popup-modal__content product-guarantee-modal__content" tabindex="-1"><header class="product-guarantee-modal__header"><h2 id="ReassuranceGuaranteeHeading-{{ block.id }}">Risk Free for 60 Days</h2><button id="ModalClose-ReassuranceGuarantee-{{ block.id }}" type="button" class="product-guarantee-modal__close" aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">{{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</button></header><div class="product-guarantee-modal__body rte"><p>Contact Customer Care within 60 days of delivery if a product purchased directly from RomanSkinCare.com is not right for you. Opened products are eligible when at least 50% remains.</p><p>Sets and bundles must be returned together. Original and return shipping charges are not refundable unless the item arrived damaged, defective, or incorrect.</p><a href="/pages/contact" class="button button--primary">Contact Customer Care</a></div></div></modal-dialog>
